# {{lb|mul|in [[transliterate]]d [[Cyrillic]] text}} Transliteration of the [[soft sign]] ([[ь]]), indicating [[palatalization]] of preceding consonants.
# {{lb|mul|in [[transliterate]]d [[Arabic]] and [[Hebrew]] text}} Transliteration of the [[glottal stop]] ([[hamza]]).
